How do I have lm-sensors report the fan speed of the fans attached to my
Asus X99-A motherboard? (Right now I can only seed the fan speeds by
booting into BIOS.)

lm-sensors does a good job of temperatures:

$ sensors
coretemp-isa-0000
Adapter: ISA adapter
